ning and linen change are included, ensuring a clean and well-maintained living environment without additional effort.\n\nAll utilities (heating, electricity, water, WiFi) are included in the rental price, making budgeting easy and transparent.\n\n📍 Location\nThe apartment is located in a calm and well-connected area at Lochhamer Str., 82152 Planegg, offering excellent access to public transport, shops and everyday amenities. It’s ideal for medium- to long-term stays for anyone working or studying in the Munich area while appreciating a quieter suburban setting.\n","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"0"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"carpet"},"garden":{"value":"shared"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"no"},"parking":{"value":"shared"},"pets":{"value":"discussable"},"playMusic":{"value":"no"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"18"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":195000,"deposit":0,"agencyFee":5000,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"1950.00","deposit":"0.00","agencyFee":"50.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":1,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":18,"maxAge":50,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31",